  "method": {
    "runtime": "Node.js 24.22.3, Sherpa-ONNX 1.13.8, Linux x64, CPU, one model thread. X-ASR uses OfflineRecognizer with modelConfig.transducer and greedy search; Paraformer uses modelConfig.paraformer. Both use 16 kHz mono PCM with 80-dimensional features and zero-pad inputs below 2,400 samples. Neither decoder receives a language hint, dictionary, or text correction.",
